{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Simple Crypto Portfolio 是一款毋須建立帳戶即可追蹤加密貨幣投資組合的工具，亦毋須交出個人資料，適合想快速掌握持倉、價格與整體表現的投資者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<p>可查看投資組合總值與個別持倉，並追蹤每日變動、持倉比例、動能及最大升跌；支援主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具、本地 JSON 備份匯入匯出，亦可自選貨幣、主題和強調色。所有資料僅儲存在裝置上，毋須帳戶，也不追蹤用家；此 App 只作追蹤，不連接交易所或提供交易功能，價格可能延遲，僅供參考，並非財務建議。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-556-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-557-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-558-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-559-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-560-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Simple Crypto Portfolio</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T05:19:42.381886+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}